    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1028">

                <pb facs="0779" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/3320</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Garrett to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laredo, Texas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-13T22:00:00-06:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1916, 10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Chamal colonists in mountain sent a messenger to me requesting me to ask
                    Department’s assistance to get them out as they have been robbed until they have
                    neither food nor money to reach border and <pb facs="0780" n="704"
                        xml:id="pg704"/> this is why they have not come. The cheapest and best route
                    is through Laredo, and if Department will authorize me to do so I will send one
                    of the colony from here and bring them out.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Garrett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
